{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/96fc23422be6ca1f85f302546d16f30e.avif?t=1773959346\" width=856 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/71914e8bd2f415af57a9db5e6e134aed.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/71914e8bd2f415af57a9db5e6e134aed.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take your orders and design unique collections. Use different fabrics from cotton to linen to create unique collections with thousands of combinations. Every corner of your workshop, from the smallest scissors to the largest shelf, is the reflection of your art.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/bf63b3ea5d389a23946c2e7f610d3dd6.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/bf63b3ea5d389a23946c2e7f610d3dd6.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/cd368020ea1575e500e03e512e286d34.avif?t=1773959346\" width=856 height=107 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/331a9ac393bee3b1e34c7c4f36f75bd4.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/331a9ac393bee3b1e34c7c4f36f75bd4.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your journey in an old, abandoned workshop and turn it into your dream tailor workshop. Buy new furniture, tear down walls and deliver best tailoring experience to your customers. Every decision you make will affect your production capacity and visual appeal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/3c8c506fca8dfab52b284d3bd83ed0e2.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/3c8c506fca8dfab52b284d3bd83ed0e2.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/33358f68c6d3567a8fff637e86606680.avif?t=1773959346\" width=856 height=107 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/915c4ede3fcdd1f7b616c41b22e554cd.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/915c4ede3fcdd1f7b616c41b22e554cd.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your inventory perfectly. Hire staff, build shelves, and organize your deliveries to meet the deadlines. How you manage your production process will affect your revenue and reputation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/bbdbf3e51c4ea30ebf05ed4dbd3e8016.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/bbdbf3e51c4ea30ebf05ed4dbd3e8016.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/833b61e1f3aeb46f46748be42c33c918.avif?t=1773959346\" width=856 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/e3f5ca3e4446f7fe1ffc2de4dc8fb7f7.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/e3f5ca3e4446f7fe1ffc2de4dc8fb7f7.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emporium District is the most vibrant area of France. Explore the district, make new friends, and enjoy exciting experiences. You will have a unique opportunity to discover the Emporium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/a58d0020dae25e4017cb93948320563e.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/a58d0020dae25e4017cb93948320563e.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484750?t=1773959346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/36c529366a361d990594ccb566a2e0cbef15899c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773959346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/a18467f5c5d33a76182e7629628db2f9def5547d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773959346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/a18467f5c5d33a76182e7629628db2f9def5547d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773959346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Road Map</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/84c8718f8f0a290e3690d01411366a96.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1560 height=727 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/96fc23422be6ca1f85f302546d16f30e.avif?t=1773959346\" width=856 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/71914e8bd2f415af57a9db5e6e134aed.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/71914e8bd2f415af57a9db5e6e134aed.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take your orders and design unique collections. Use different fabrics from cotton to linen to create unique collections with thousands of combinations. Every corner of your workshop, from the smallest scissors to the largest shelf, is the reflection of your art.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/bf63b3ea5d389a23946c2e7f610d3dd6.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/bf63b3ea5d389a23946c2e7f610d3dd6.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/cd368020ea1575e500e03e512e286d34.avif?t=1773959346\" width=856 height=107 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/331a9ac393bee3b1e34c7c4f36f75bd4.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/331a9ac393bee3b1e34c7c4f36f75bd4.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your journey in an old, abandoned workshop and turn it into your dream tailor workshop. Buy new furniture, tear down walls and deliver best tailoring experience to your customers. Every decision you make will affect your production capacity and visual appeal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/3c8c506fca8dfab52b284d3bd83ed0e2.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/3c8c506fca8dfab52b284d3bd83ed0e2.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/33358f68c6d3567a8fff637e86606680.avif?t=1773959346\" width=856 height=107 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/915c4ede3fcdd1f7b616c41b22e554cd.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/915c4ede3fcdd1f7b616c41b22e554cd.webm?t=1773959346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your inventory perfectly. Hire staff, build shelves, and organize your deliveries to meet the deadlines. How you manage your production process will affect your revenue and reputation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/bbdbf3e51c4ea30ebf05ed4dbd3e8016.poster.avif?t=1773959346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/bbdbf3e51c4ea30